class "App\nordinary drafts per Session" as App
class "ComposerBox\nmenu / palette / chip / arguments" as Composer
class "useCommandComposer\nselected / replacement / pending" as Draft
class "DebugHeaders\npage memory / three optional presets" as Headers
class "CommandInvocation\nimmutable request + result kind" as Invocation
class "useRuntimeApi\nSession + ETag + view generation" as Coordinator
class "Event store\neventId + complete / preview" as Store
class "Timeline / Confirmation" as Timeline
class "Builtin result region\nephemeral, plain text" as Result
class "Protocol decoder\nstateless JSON / SSE" as Decoder
class "Command result decoder\nstateless" as Commands
interface "Claw HTTP v2" as HTTP
App *-left- Composer : active Session view
Composer *-down- Draft : owns command draft
App *-right- Headers : DEV page lifetime
Headers -down-> App : snapshot for each write
Draft -down-> Invocation : freeze Descriptor + arguments
Draft -right-> App : execute callback / message intent
App -down-> Coordinator : user intent
Invocation -down-> Coordinator : fixed invocation
Coordinator -right-> HTTP : Session / Events / Commands
HTTP -down-> Decoder : strict wire validation
Coordinator o-down- Store : one active Session
Decoder -left-> Store : live + ordered history
Store -down-> Timeline : complete + current root
Coordinator -left-> Commands : invocation + JSON
Commands -down-> Result : Builtin only
note bottom of Store
  All state belongs to the current view.
  View generation rejects late responses.
  Abort closes observation, not execution.
end note
note left of Draft
  Catalog remains authoritative.
  Selection does not execute.
  Cancel / success restores ordinary draft.
  Disposal ignores late completion.
end note
@enduml
